  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Buzz Women Ukraine</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The most recent war propelled  many women into entrepreneurship. They face the &quot;normal&quot; obstacles for entrepreneurship, discrimination and an increase of family obligations, now the men are at the front.This project provides female entrepreneurs a save environment to learn business skills, receive coaching/mentoring and find business partners. It gives the women a better chance to succeed in their business and contribute to economic recovery.</narrative>
  </description>
